00:43:11.770 --> 00:43:15.870
Well, you know, in Boys and Girls, one of my favorite moments is the character reveal
因为当时男人们围成了一个圈。

992
00:43:15.870 --> 00:43:18.250
that you're there because it's just the men in a circle.
男人们的抱怨大会。

993
00:43:18.590 --> 00:43:18.970
Guys gripe session.
没错。

994
00:43:19.110 --> 00:43:19.270
Yeah.
是的。

995
00:43:19.370 --> 00:43:19.610
Yeah.
然后你探出身子。

996
00:43:19.770 --> 00:43:21.310
And then you lean forward.
你就出现在那儿了。

997
00:43:21.510 --> 00:43:22.970
And there you are.
每次看这一段我都笑得不行。

998
00:43:22.970 --> 00:43:25.850
And it busts me up every time I watch it.
丹尼偷偷加了那一幕。

999
00:43:26.430 --> 00:43:27.470
Denny snuck that one.
我爱死她了。

1000
00:43:27.610 --> 00:43:28.390
I love her.
我爱死她了。

1001
00:43:28.590 --> 00:43:29.990
She was so much fun.
她真的太有趣了。

1002
00:43:30.210 --> 00:43:31.870
We were all sitting on boxes.
我们当时都坐在箱子上。

1003
00:43:31.870 --> 00:43:34.730
And she was like, hide behind David and John.
她说，躲在大卫和约翰后面。

1004
00:43:35.210 --> 00:43:36.590
And I was like, what?
我说，什么？

1005
00:43:36.910 --> 00:43:37.410
Okay.
好吧。

1006
00:43:37.730 --> 00:43:44.610
And then I think somehow or another, David, out of the corner of his eye, looks back at
然后我想大卫不知怎么地，用眼角余光往后看了

1007
00:43:44.610 --> 00:43:44.870
me.
我一眼。

1008
00:43:44.990 --> 00:43:50.850
Or he looks out of the corner of his eye to, like, indicate to Michael, there's somebody
或者他用眼角余光示意迈克尔，这里还有

1009
00:43:50.850 --> 00:43:51.490
else here.
别人在。

