1023
00:44:31.130 --> 00:44:31.370
Yeah.
是啊。

1024
00:44:31.530 --> 00:44:31.930
I know.
我知道。

1025
00:44:32.090 --> 00:44:32.930
That would have been wonderful.
那会很棒的。

1026
00:44:33.210 --> 00:44:34.310
But it was funny.
但那很有趣。

1027
00:44:34.470 --> 00:44:35.010
It was funny.
真的很有趣。

1028
00:44:35.010 --> 00:44:37.310
And Denny choreographed that really well.
丹妮把那段编排得非常好。

1029
00:44:37.710 --> 00:44:38.390
She was just like—
她当时就是——

1030
00:44:39.230 --> 00:44:43.990
