My Garfield pasta?
我的加菲猫意面？

1040
00:44:57.350 --> 00:44:57.790
Yes.
没错。

1041
00:44:58.950 --> 00:44:59.390
Yes.
是的。

1042
00:45:00.110 --> 00:45:03.750
Well, it's been added back to the Peacock Superfan episode.
嗯，它已经被加回Peacock的超级粉丝版剧集里了。

1043
00:45:04.070 --> 00:45:06.030
Let me set it up, and then we're going to listen to it.
让我先铺垫一下，然后我们再来听听看。

1044
00:45:06.150 --> 00:45:06.330
Okay.
好的。

1045
00:45:06.630 --> 00:45:09.730
So this is the party that Jim and Dwight are planning.
这是吉姆和德怀特正在筹划的派对。

1046
00:45:10.070 --> 00:45:15.550
And Jim is nervous because the warehouse folks have now been invited to this party,
吉姆很紧张，因为仓库的人现在也被邀请参加这个派对，

1047
00:45:15.590 --> 00:45:17.790
