So everybody's standing in line from the warehouse to get food.
所以仓库的人都在排队领食物。

1049
00:45:21.830 --> 00:45:29.450
And he says, it's just finger foods, kind of like, please don't take a lot, and one lasagna.
他说，这只是些手指小食，言下之意是，请别拿太多，还有一份千层面。

1050
00:45:30.470 --> 00:45:31.950
And then here's what happens.
然后接下来发生了这样的事。

1051
00:45:32.850 --> 00:45:35.770
So guys, this is more like finger food.
伙计们，这更像是手指小食。

1052
00:45:35.890 --> 00:45:36.890
Uh-oh, a lasagna.
噢，是千层面。

1053
00:45:37.070 --> 00:45:38.010
Look out, Garfield.
小心点，加菲猫。

1054
00:45:39.070 --> 00:45:39.690
Uh-oh.
噢。

1055
00:45:39.930 --> 00:45:40.650
What does that mean?
那是什么意思？

1056
00:45:40.710 --> 00:45:42.030
Oh, they call me Garfield.
噢，他们都叫我加菲猫。

1057
00:45:42.190 --> 00:45:44.790
I've never seen a lasagna not eat in the whole pan.
我从没见过有人不把整盘千层面吃光的。

1058
00:45:45.050 --> 00:45:45.930
Oh, I wish you wouldn't.
噢，我希望你别那样。

1059
00:45:46.090 --> 00:45:48.210
Oh, well, I can't help myself.
噢，好吧，我控制不住我自己。

1060
00:45:48.210 --> 00:45:51.790
Can you imagine what it's like for me, that it has that power over me?
你能想象吗，它对我有着那样的诱惑力，我该怎么办？

1061
00:45:51.970 --> 00:45:52.890
I've got to have some.
我必须得吃点。

1062
00:45:53.350 --> 00:45:54.190
Sorry, guys.
抱歉，伙计们。

1063
00:45:54.750 --> 00:45:55.430
Everybody get some?
大家都拿到了吗？

1064
00:45:55.810 --> 00:45:56.710
I got mine.
我拿到了。

1065
00:45:56.990 --> 00:45:57.130
Okay.
好的。

1066
00:46:00.280 --> 00:46:02.040
Okay, so that's the scene.
好了，场景就是这样。

1067
00:46:02.040 --> 00:46:03.400
